From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: VectraOS port <port@vectraos.invalid>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 04:56:25 -0600
Subject: [VectraOS] A window system for VectraOS

VectraOSNativeSystem: a window of Radharc's, VectraOS's compositor, as a
surface through VK_VECTRA_window_surface (vulkan_vectra.h, included after
Khronos's headers), presented to through VK_KHR_swapchain. --size is the
window's size in points and the swapchain's extent the surface's current
one in pixels; --fullscreen asks for the screen and waits for the resize.
Closing the window or pressing Escape ends the run. The probe is good
where the program's namespace has /svc/windows. Radharc presents FIFO
only, so mailbox, vkmark's default, becomes FIFO.
